# =========================
# Project-Specific Files
# =========================
# Ignore generated visualization outputs (images/videos)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.mp4

# Ignore large generated datasets and output logs
/output/
/generated_graphs/
*.log

# Note: You likely want to track your JSON templates, but if you 
# start generating massive 1000x1000 grid JSONs, you can ignore 
# all JSONs except your specific templates like this:
# *.json
# !template.json
# !config.json
